{
  "id": "LUK.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Lk 13",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Embelekenyunye entung'uai ingok inyi aashu iyeye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii apa kulikae ootii ine ina kata ootolikitio Yesu eneikuna Pilato Ilgalilaya ootara metuata neitushulaki osarge oloo lasarri lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki ninche ajoki, “Ijojo pasa ai lelo Galilaya oota ng'ok aalang ilkulikae Galilaya pooki, eji amu neijia eikunaki enkitamioto? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajoki ntae, mme neijia; kake te neitu iridudu sii ntae nindaayaya aaiko neijia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aashu doi lapa oora tomon o isiet ootuurokine enkaji naado te Siloam near metuata, ijojo pasa ninche larruok aalang ilkulikae pooki oomanya apa Yerusalem? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajoki ntae mme neijia; kake te neitu irridudu sii ntae nindaayaya aaiko neijia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkintanyaanyukoto o lng'aboli lemeiu lng'anayio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neinosaki ena kitanyaanyukoto: “Eeta apa oltung'ani olng'aboli ouno te nkurma enye oo lng'anayio nelotu aing'orunye lng'anayio neitu etumie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki oloramat ilng'anayio, ‘Eji larin okuni taata alotu ake aing'orunye ele ng'aboli lng'anayio, nematumie, tudung'o tuuroi; oo pee etumuta enkop?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki ajoki, ‘Tapala, lo kitok, te le ari sii taata, matuturoki napik entulugumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee etoiwuo lng'anayio te le ari olotu naa sidai; kake te neitu, nidung auroo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishiunye Yesu enkitok tarrush te nkolong e sabato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eiteng'enisho apa ninye te nkaji nabo te nkolong e sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii enkitok naata oloirirua le lepori too larin tomon o isiet; neaku keirrugori meidim ataraposhunye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee edol Yesu ninye, neipot, nejoki, “Na kitok, kitooruoki entasato ino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiteleiki nkaik enyena, neraposhunye te ina kata. Neisis Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.9+EXO.20.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 20.9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.13+DEU.5.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 5.13-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake etagore olkitok le nkaji e ntumo enkaraki naishiunye Yesu olorere te nkolong e sabato nejoki olorere, “Eetai nkolong'i ile naaishiaakino neasieki esiaai; wootu te nena olong'i meishiunyeki ntae, neme te nkolong e sabato.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki taa Olaitoriani nejoki, “Lo sunkuro! Keetae obo linyi lemelaku olkiteng anaa osikiria lenye to lale te nkolong e sabato, nerik aitook enkare? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paa ai meishiaakino ninye ena kitok, entito e Abraham nateena shetani larin tomon o isiet ai meishiaakino netalakuaki te nkolong e sabato.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ejo neijia, nekurru lelo pooki ooing'orunore; neshipa olorere pooki too mbaa pooki e nkisisa naataasa ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkitanyaanyukoto e nkantererai e karadali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki taa ajoki, “Kaji eikununo enkitoria e Nkai? Naa ainyoo pasa eitanyaanyukieki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiu anaa enkantererai e karadali natuuno oltung'ani te nkurma enye; nebulu aaku olchani, nemany intaritik ilng'osil lenyena aapik isinkin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkitanyaanyukoto e nkaisiijoi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ake Yesu ajoki, “Ainyoo pasa aitanyaanyukie enkitoria e Nkai? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiu anaa enkisuijoi natudumua enkitok neitushulaki mboreitin uni e nkano, o metaba anaa neisuijoyu pooki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kutuk aji napirik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neimaa nkang'itie sapuki oo nkutiti neiteng'enisho eloito enkalo e Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki oltung'ani obo, “Olaitoriani, ai kuti pasa lelo oojeu?” Nejoki ninche, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Entonyok eimu kutuk aji napirik; amu ajoki ntae, eyooki lkumok aaing'oru pee eimu nelaikino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eaku einyo olopeny enkaji aiken kutuk aji, ninteruru aaitashoo te boo ioshiosho kutuk aji ijojo, ‘Olaitoriani, tabolu iyiook.’ Newaliki ninye ntae ajoki, ‘Mayiolo nanu ajo kaji ng'uaa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nintokiki taa aajo, ‘Kitadaate nikitookishote o iyie, ninteng'enishe too nkoitoi ang naalala enkanas.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
